0.1.0 (unreleased)
==================

First version of the Malaysia icon theme, forked from Adwaita 51.0. Adwaita's own
release history is in its repository, https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme,
and in this repository's git log up to commit 75a7cc2.

- Rename the theme to Malaysia and inherit from Adwaita and hicolor. Drop 16x16/,
  symbolic/legacy and symbolic/emotes, which now resolve through Adwaita.
- Bring the 97 symbols the Malaysia desktop draws in code into the theme under
  freedesktop names: 71 replace Adwaita's drawing, 26 are new, including the
  window-tile-* icons.
- Generate 15 folders, 26 file types and the Settings and Screenshot app icons.
- Redraw the 22 device icons, plus audio-card, in the style of the device pictures in
  Malaysia's Settings.
- Add Malaysia-Dark, a child theme with dark folders and app icons, and a
  generator for a theme tinted with the user's accent color.
- Check exports, generated icons and installation in CI.
